      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_f67803e7",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "纷纭众生，同声咏唱其名；千万喉舌，齐颂终末福音。祂与祂的「国度」必将降临。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_e9b8586d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "执掌「融合」权柄的「神明」，根植于黎那汐塔文明的鸣式。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_24ba04bf",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "自岁主枷锁中逃逸的频率因「宝石」得以苏生，以昔日圣女「芙露德莉斯」为原型，为自己再度创造了神躯。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_131c89be",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "祂自生命联结的渴望中降诞，因万物恒远的恐惧而长存，如深渊般静默回响，永世凝望。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0167b0aa",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "所有的异信者与无信者，皆当领受审判。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
